# ghost — authored from all eight walk facings in pix/ghost.png (design §16).
# A hovering ragged tail supports a deep shroud: sleeves spread in both axes
# so the side facings stay broad, and the eyes sit inside a dark hood recess.
# Layers run bottom-up; first row is back, last row is front.

